//! A person's account as the account library arranges it: a thing its nodes hold admin or write
//! on, holding its profile (what others read about the person) and its inbox (where grants and
//! requests from others arrive). Things made for the person are minted with the account as admin.
revision 1;

/// On an account: its profile.
aspect account:profile.0: weak;

/// On a profile: the account it is the profile of.
aspect account:of.0: weak;

/// On an account: its contact card (a read link to its profile), made once and handed to
/// whoever may grant the account roles.
aspect account:card.0: string;

/// On an account: the profiles of the accounts whose contact cards it imported, by account.
aspect account:contacts.0: map<weak, weak>;
